title: "Public Value Guide"
message: "If you use this guide, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: "Joel Parker"
    family-names: "Henderson"
    email: "joel@joelparkerhenderson.com"
abstract: >-
  A practical handbook of best practices for creating public value in
  government and the social sector, grounded in Mark Moore's public value
  framework, covering foundations, evaluation and evidence, governance and
  systems, global and societal issues, and digital government and
  technology, in fifteen locales.
keywords:
  - public value
  - public administration
  - public policy
  - social sector
  - nonprofit management
  - government
